      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "415c310c61e41c69",
      "translationZh": "local 层级（Qwen 3 7B / Llama 3.3 8B / Mistral Small 3）——无需网络、零成本、可离线运行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b9aeabde11f5aec6",
      "translationZh": "cloud_budget 层级（Luna, Haiku 4.5, DeepSeek V4 Flash）——价格低廉，适合日常工作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7e6f8a020a765833",
